  "description": "Power, presence and pure muscle—meet the Beast™, our burliest bike yet. For those who want to own the road, this fat-tire eBike is the ultimate in stability and control. With a 750W motor and 48V 20Ah battery you’ll get 35-50+ miles of range, so you can ride longer and farther. Cruise up to 20mph whether you’re in the city or on the scenic route. The Beast’s tough design and big power means it’s for confident riders who want style and substance.\nNow with an updated torque sensor and 48T chainring, providing a smoother acceleration and a more controlled pedal assist. As a Class 1 eBike, the Beast™ delivers responsive pedal assist power, giving access to more bike paths and trails where Class 2 bikes may be restricted. Want extra flexibility? Add-on the optional throttle to enjoy power on demand.",
